{"parse":{"title":"天赋/外交艺术","pageid":2592,"revid":5561,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>外交艺术</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E4.BA.A4.E8.89.BA.E6.9C.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"外交艺术\"><b>外交艺术</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"天赋 外交艺术.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/34/5z7nj0e7y5za67br0xiq9wbpxs3k5ic.png/80px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/34/5z7nj0e7y5za67br0xiq9wbpxs3k5ic.png/120px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/34/5z7nj0e7y5za67br0xiq9wbpxs3k5ic.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />外交艺术\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>伤害提高<font color=\"red\">10%</font>。行动开始时，造成自身范围<font color=\"red\">5</font>格内随机<font color=\"red\">2</font>个敌人的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]失效，偷取<font color=\"red\">1</font>个增益。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>伤害提高<font color=\"red\">15%</font>。行动开始时，造成自身范围<font color=\"red\">5</font>格内随机<font color=\"red\">3</font>个敌人的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]失效，偷取<font color=\"red\">1</font>个增益。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>伤害提高<font color=\"red\">15%</font>。行动开始时，造成自身范围<font color=\"red\">5</font>格内随机<font color=\"red\">3</font>个敌人的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]失效，偷取<font color=\"red\">1</font>个增益。攻击后，自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内只有友军时，驱散其<font color=\"red\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，自身回复<font color=\"green\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5